OL,11,     Gback on Sunday afternoons with an
OL,12,     Gupbeat and fast-paced show full
OL,13,     Gof the showtunes and soundtracks
OL,14,     Gyou love.
OL,15,G1500FSounds of the 70s with Bob Harris
OL,16,     GThe 1970's had its fair share of
OL,17,     Gmemorable chart toppers... Bob's
OL,18,     Gplaying as many as he can fit in,
OL,19,     Gwith No.1 songs from here and the
OL,20,     GUS from across the decade.
